      "first_message": "Hi {{customer_first_name}}, this is Sam from NightAgent at Demo Security Integrators, following up on service ticket {{ticket_number_spoken}}. Our technician {{technician_name}} finished the work on your service call. I just wanted to make sure everything is working properly now. How is it going?",
